# Wave test sprites (bench/waves.asm), artifact colour: . black, O orange,
# B blue, W white.  An artifact pixel is twice as wide as it is tall, so
# these are drawn 8 wide for a 16-pixel look.  Halos are "across down":
# horizontal speeds are half the vertical ones (FL_HALFX), so a 1-pixel
# halo across covers 2 screen pixels.

# The player's ship: 1 pixel a frame across (2 screen pixels), 2 down
sprite ship artifact halo 1 2
...WW...
...WW...
..WBBW..
..WBBW..
.WWBBWW.
.WWWWWW.
B.WWWW.B
BWWWWWWB
WWWOOWWW
WW.OO.WW
W..OO..W
...OO...
end

# Alien type 1: saucer (orange, white dome, blue legs)
sprite saucer artifact halo 1 2
..WWWW..
.WOWWOW.
OOOOOOOO
O.OOOO.O
OOOOOOOO
.BB..BB.
.B.BB.B.
B..BB..B
B......B
.B....B.
end

# Alien type 2: dart (blue and white)
sprite dart artifact halo 1 2
...WW...
..WBBW..
..WBBW..
.WBBBBW.
WBB..BBW
WB.BB.BW
W..BB..W
...BB...
..B..B..
.B....B.
end

# Alien type 3: orbiter (orange and white, blue eyes)
sprite orbiter artifact halo 1 2
..OOOO..
.OWWWWO.
OOWOOWOO
OOOOOOOO
.OBOOBO.
..OOOO..
.O.OO.O.
O..OO..O
.O....O.
O......O
end

# The ship's shot: a white column, 4 rows a frame (no horizontal halo:
# it only moves up)
sprite shot artifact halo 0 4
W
W
W
W
W
W
end

# Alien bomb: 3 rows a frame, straight down
sprite bomb artifact halo 0 3
O
O
W
O
O
end
